<title>USA: Country Maid Foods to buy back stock.</title>
<headline>Country Maid Foods to buy back stock.</headline>
<dateline>AURORA, Mo. 1996-12-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Country Maid Foods Inc said Tuesday that its board of directors has authorized a program to repurchase up to 2.5 million shares of its common stock.</p>
<p>This represents about five percent of the shares outstanding, the agricultural products company said.</p>
<p>Purchases will be made in the open market or in negotiated transactions, the company said.</p>
<p>((--Chicago newsdesk 312 408 8787))</p>
